//The boss having the Boss flag set seems to prevent them from getting autolevels, so let's do this jank to simulate it.
ApplyBonusLevelsToUnit(BossBanditTrialValleyOfDeath, 33) //A +19 from being promoted, a +14 from being level 5, so +33 total.
GotoPrepScreen

EndingScene:
MoveToChapterWithoutWM(CHAPTER_PostGame)
